          <msContents>
            <summary>
              Autograph letter / address from Louis XVI to the Assemblée Nationale, dated
              31 December 1791 (31 xbre 1791), concerning the imperial note delivered to the
              French Ambassador in Vienna regarding émigré assemblies on the territory of
              the Elector of Trier and France's demands for their dispersal.
            </summary>
            <msItem xml:id="item1">
              <locus from="f.1r" to="f.1r">f. 1r</locus>
              <title type="supplied">Address to the Assemblée Nationale on the Imperial Note concerning the Elector of Trier</title>
              <textLang mainLang="fr">French</textLang>
            </msItem>
          </msContents>
